Upstream source: https://go.googlesource.com/go
Fork source: https://github.com/otpki/iogo

IOGO adds post-quantum signature schemes, curve and hash support, signer
adapters, and X.509 extensions. It is not an official Go distribution.

The module depends on OTPKI's fork of Cloudflare CIRCL, filippo.io/bigmod,
golang.org/x/crypto, and other modules listed in go.mod and go.sum. These
dependencies retain their own licenses and copyright notices; this file
does not replace or change their terms. Source fixtures retain any notices
in their accompanying files, including crypto/x509/testdata/nist-pkits/README.md.
